== (iii) robustness under record noise ==
   Q = 1, link noise eps = 0.1: index = 1   (Tr formula +1.000000)
   Q = 1, link noise eps = 0.25: index = 1   (Tr formula +1.000000)
   Q = 2, link noise eps = 0.1: index = 2   (Tr formula +2.000000)
   Q = 2, link noise eps = 0.25: index = 2   (Tr formula +2.000000)
  -> the index is a SECTOR LABEL: invariant under record noise,
     not a fine-tuned spectral accident.

